{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"OESA-2026-4964","published":"2026-11-19T01:43:33Z","modified":"2026-11-19T02:00:37.383845101Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-120740"],"summary":"hivex security update","details":"Hivex is a library for extracting the contents of Windows Registry &amp;quot;hive&amp;quot; files.  It is designed to be secure against buggy or malicious registry files.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in hivex. By supplying a specially crafted Windows registry hive file, an attacker can trigger an out-of-bounds memory read when hivex parses registry values containing malformed large data block lists. This issue can cause the application processing the registry file to crash, resulting in a Denial of Service (DoS).(CVE-2026-120740)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"hivex","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/hivex&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","hivex-debuginfo-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","hivex-debugsource-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","hivex-devel-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ocaml-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ocaml-hivex-devel-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","perl-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","python3-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ruby-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["hivex-help-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","hivex-debuginfo-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","hivex-debugsource-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","hivex-devel-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","ocaml-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","ocaml-hivex-devel-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","perl-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","python3-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","ruby-hivex-1.3.23-3.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.o